{"meta":{"seed":n:40b0920000000000,"ticksRequested":n:4086800000000000,"founders":[{"name":s:"Ask the First","traits":{"curiosity":n:3feccccccccccccd,"social":n:3fd999999999999a,"diligence":n:3fe3333333333333,"conformity":n:3fd3333333333333,},},{"name":s:"Embla the First",},{"traits":{"social":n:3feb333333333333,},},null,],"engine":s:"emergence-engine.js","engineVersion":s:"2.6.0",},"events":[{"id":n:0000000000000000,"tick":n:0000000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"start","txt":s:"🌍 Four humans wake in an untouched world: <b>Ask the First</b>, <b>Embla the First</b>, <b>Embla</b>, <b>Torv</b>. They know nothing — but they can observe everything. What will they create?",},{"id":n:3ff0000000000000,"tick":n:401c000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📖 <b>Ask the First</b> told the day back as a story worth remembering — <b>Ask the First's the tale</b> (Storytelling) has been invented! <i>The first culture — memory shaped into meaning.</i>","tech":s:"storytelling","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b800000000000,"y":n:4040000000000000,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4000000000000000,"tick":n:4024000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Embla the First</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:4008000000000000,"tick":n:4030000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ask the First</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c69121b743333,"y":n:403fced5595c6667,},{"id":n:4010000000000000,"tick":n:4052800000000000,"day":n:4010000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that a struck string and a hollow log ring with a voice. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"soundsRing","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:40472e8c0a61ee40,"y":n:404223f4bb9956ad,},{"id":n:4014000000000000,"tick":n:405cc00000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Liv</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:4046e289a32c2571,"y":n:4042c3b51530724c,"causes":[s:"agent:4",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4018000000000000,"tick":n:405d000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ The first winter has come. The world turns white and hard, and the nights grow long. Fire is no longer comfort — it is life.",},{"id":n:401c000000000000,"tick":n:405d800000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔥 <b>Embla</b> rubbed sticks together until a spark caught the tinder — <b>Embla's blaze</b> (Fire) has been invented! <i>Warmth at night. Opens the path to pottery and smithing.</i>","tech":s:"fire","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4046c33e0e61cd57,"y":n:40430794d005adfe,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4020000000000000,"tick":n:405d800000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Embla</b> was known as <b>Embla the Firebringer</b>.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4046c33e0e61cd57,"y":n:40430794d005adfe,},{"id":n:4022000000000000,"tick":n:405e000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that a bent branch fights to spring back. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"branchBends","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4046c33e0e61cd57,"y":n:40430794d005adfe,},{"id":n:4024000000000000,"tick":n:4060c00000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:40477a2e24b28bd8,"y":n:404255aad08ba580,},{"id":n:4026000000000000,"tick":n:4061000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla the Firebringer</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4045d04907689a24,"y":n:40424e4f7c307aca,},{"id":n:4028000000000000,"tick":n:4061200000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Ask the First</b> began believing the sky-wheel turns with the seasons and can be read like tracks in snow — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(the Sky-Wheel)</i>","custom":s:"c1","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404e306c1260bf6b,"y":n:403a2e56af6b3d72,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:402a000000000000,"tick":n:4061200000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 <b>Ask the First</b> saw a pattern in the stars and gave it a name — <b>the Sky-Wheel</b>. From watching, a cosmology is born: the first faith of the sky.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"label":s:"A RELIGION OF THE SKY",},{"id":n:402c000000000000,"tick":n:4062000000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:402e000000000000,"tick":n:4062600000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪢 <b>Embla</b> twisted grass fibers into something strong — <b>Embla's braid</b> (Rope) has been invented! <i>Makes it possible to bind parts together.</i>","tech":s:"rope","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404595d5daddcd57,"y":n:404223cb0f077aca,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4030000000000000,"tick":n:4062600000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Embla</b> began believing the world repeats and can be understood — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(The Knowing Eye)</i>","custom":s:"c2","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404595d5daddcd57,"y":n:404223cb0f077aca,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:4031000000000000,"tick":n:4064000000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧶 <b>Embla</b> crossed threads over threads until cloth grew on the frame — <b>Embla's warp-craft</b> (Weaving) has been invented! <i>Cloth for warmth and trade — and hands that specialize.</i>","tech":s:"weaving","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404557ca1e3833be,"y":n:4041c873977eadfe,"causes":[s:"ev:15",],},{"id":n:4032000000000000,"tick":n:4068000000000000,"day":n:4022000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Ask the First's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:4033000000000000,"tick":n:406ca00000000000,"day":n:4024000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Embla the First</b> starved to death.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404a7fd6fefde6ec,"y":n:403bbda41ecf8a02,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:4034000000000000,"tick":n:406fc00000000000,"day":n:4026000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla the Firebringer</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:4035000000000000,"tick":n:4070400000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4036000000000000,"tick":n:4071d00000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔢 <b>Ask the First</b> matched pebble to sheep and found number itself — <b>Ask the First's number</b> (Counting) has been invented! <i>The world made countable — trade, calendars and mathematics begin.</i>","tech":s:"numbers","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404bf1702d0f9eba,"y":n:4042d17be24b12ee,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4037000000000000,"tick":n:4072e00000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ask the First</b> noticed that struck stone breaks into sharp shards. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"sharpShards","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b44a4e772cf9b,"y":n:404525e1f8319359,},{"id":n:4038000000000000,"tick":n:4073000000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ask the First</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b892f34e502ce,"y":n:404554daddb66026,"causes":[s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:4039000000000000,"tick":n:4073600000000000,"day":n:402c000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔪 <b>Ask the First</b> struck two stones together and kept the sharp shard — <b>Ask the First's knife</b> (Sharpened stone) has been invented! <i>Faster gathering of everything.</i>","tech":s:"sharp","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b892f34e502ce,"y":n:404554daddb66026,"causes":[],},{"id":n:403a000000000000,"tick":n:4079400000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:403b000000000000,"tick":n:4079500000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4010000000000000,},{"id":n:403c000000000000,"tick":n:407b000000000000,"day":n:4033000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:403d000000000000,"tick":n:407e900000000000,"day":n:4035000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Ask the First's number. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"numbers",},{"id":n:403e000000000000,"tick":n:407f600000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎵 <b>Embla</b> found that a struck string and a voice could ring together — <b>Embla's the song</b> (Music) has been invented! <i>Song at the fire — the root of every art to come.</i>","tech":s:"song","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404abb25e5acccea,"y":n:404599c7eb366688,"causes":[s:"ev:1",],},{"id":n:403f000000000000,"tick":n:407fe00000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📅 <b>Embla</b> counted the stars and seasons into a fixed wheel of days — <b>Embla's star-count</b> (Calendar) has been invented! <i>The future made plannable — harvest, festival and rite find their day.</i>","tech":s:"calendar","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404a9c6ac966ccea,"y":n:404572e29bf099bb,"causes":[s:"ev:22",],},{"id":n:4040000000000000,"tick":n:4080000000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ask the First</b> noticed that spilled seeds sprout where they fall. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"seedsSprout","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404d43fdfc550fa0,"y":n:404746c79a362ad7,},{"id":n:4040800000000000,"tick":n:4080f00000000000,"day":n:4037000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Torv</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4041000000000000,"tick":n:4081200000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4041800000000000,"tick":n:4082500000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4042000000000000,"tick":n:4083380000000000,"day":n:403a000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that certain leaves ease pain and close a wound. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"herbsHeal","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404d279e7840c030,"y":n:404704a79dc5f6ef,},{"id":n:4042800000000000,"tick":n:4085a00000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4043000000000000,"tick":n:4085d00000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Ask the First's knife. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:4043800000000000,"tick":n:4086100000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🗡️ <b>Ask the First</b> lashed a sharp point to a long shaft — <b>Ask the First's javelin</b> (Spear) has been invented! <i>Humans are prey no longer. Deer can be hunted — food even in winter.</i>","tech":s:"spear","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,"causes":[s:"ev:25",s:"ev:15",],},{"id":n:4044000000000000,"tick":n:4086100000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Ask the First</b> was known as <b>Ask the First the Spearmaker</b>.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,},{"id":n:4044800000000000,"tick":n:4086480000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪓 <b>Ask the First</b> bound a hard edge to a wooden shaft — <b>Ask the First's feller</b> (Axe) has been invented! <i>Twice as fast logging. Required to build huts.</i>","tech":s:"axe","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,"causes":[s:"ev:25",s:"ev:15",],},{"id":n:4045000000000000,"tick":n:4086800000000000,"day":n:403f000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ask the First</b> raised logs against each other into a shelter — <b>Ask the First's shelter</b> (Hut) has been invented! <i>Shelter and warmth at night. Three huts close together become a village.</i>","tech":s:"hut","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,"causes":[s:"ev:41",],},],"dna":{"seed":n:40b0920000000000,"years":n:4018000000000000,"dna":{"Curious":n:403e000000000000,"Social":n:4043000000000000,"Diligent":n:4040000000000000,},"population":n:4010000000000000,"maxPop":n:4014000000000000,"generations":n:4000000000000000,"knowledgeCount":n:4026000000000000,"knowledgeMax":n:404a800000000000,"villages":[],"births":n:3ff0000000000000,"talks":n:4041000000000000,"deaths":{"starvation":n:3ff0000000000000,"cold":n:0000000000000000,"age":n:0000000000000000,"wolves":n:0000000000000000,},"knowledgeLosses":n:0000000000000000,"rediscoveries":n:0000000000000000,"failedExperiments":n:4018000000000000,"observations":n:4030000000000000,"customsCount":n:4000000000000000,"traditions":[],"taboos":[],"beliefs":[s:"the Sky-Wheel",s:"The Knowing Eye",],"conversions":n:0000000000000000,"hunts":n:0000000000000000,"harshWinters":n:0000000000000000,"reformations":n:0000000000000000,"worldview":s:"empiric","tabooBreaks":n:0000000000000000,"religions":[undef,],"legends":[s:"Embla Embla the Firebringer.",s:"Ask the First Ask the First the Spearmaker.",],"milestones":{"⚙️ Storytelling":s:"year 1","👶 First child":s:"year 1","⚙️ Fire":s:"year 1","⚙️ Rope":s:"year 2","⚙️ Weaving":s:"year 2","⚙️ Counting":s:"year 2","⚙️ Sharpened stone":s:"year 3","⚙️ Music":s:"year 4","⚙️ Calendar":s:"year 4","⚙️ Spear":s:"year 5","⚙️ Axe":s:"year 5","⚙️ Hut":s:"year 6",},"status":s:"Alive in year 6","violence":{"steals":n:0000000000000000,"raids":n:0000000000000000,"feuds":n:0000000000000000,"killings":n:0000000000000000,"brawls":n:0000000000000000,"wars":n:0000000000000000,},"trades":n:0000000000000000,"gifts":n:0000000000000000,"leaders":[],"giftWays":[],"wealthTop":s:"Ask the First the Spearmaker (7)",},"history":{"worldName":s:"World #4242","seed":n:40b0920000000000,"years":n:4018000000000000,"intro":s:"This is the chronicle of World #4242 - 6 years, 2 generations, written by no one. Every line below happened.","outro":s:"The chronicle is still being written. 4 souls carry it onward.","chapters":[{"title":s:"The Waking","from":n:3ff0000000000000,"to":n:4018000000000000,"text":[s:"🌍 Four humans wake in an untouched world: Ask the First, Embla the First, Embla, Torv. They know nothing — but they can observe everything. What will they create?",s:"The chronicle marks the year 1, when Ask the First told the day back as a story worth remembering. Ask the First's the tale entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 1, when Embla rubbed sticks together until a spark caught the tinder. Embla's blaze entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 2, when Embla twisted grass fibers into something strong. Embla's braid entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 2, when Embla crossed threads over threads until cloth grew on the frame. Embla's warp-craft entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 2, when Ask the First matched pebble to sheep and found number itself. Ask the First's number entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 3, when Ask the First struck two stones together and kept the sharp shard. Ask the First's knife entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 4, when Embla found that a struck string and a voice could ring together. Embla's the song entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 4, when Embla counted the stars and seasons into a fixed wheel of days. Embla's star-count entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 5, when Ask the First lashed a sharp point to a long shaft. Ask the First's javelin entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 5, when Ask the First bound a hard edge to a wooden shaft. Ask the First's feller entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 6, when Ask the First raised logs against each other into a shelter. Ask the First's shelter entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 1, Ask the First began seeing the world differently - believing the sky-wheel turns with the seasons and can be read like tracks in snow. Where others saw patterns, they felt a will behind them.",s:"In the year 2, Embla began seeing the world differently - believing the world repeats and can be understood. Where others saw spirits, they saw patterns.",s:"From that day on, Embla was known as Embla the Firebringer.",s:"From that day on, Ask the First was known as Ask the First the Spearmaker.",s:"In these years 1 child was born under its skies and 1 lives ended - 1 to hunger.",],},],},"endState":{"tick":n:4086800000000000,"hour":n:4018000000000000,"day":n:403f000000000000,"season":s:"spring","ended":false,"endedYear":undef,"maxPop":n:4014000000000000,"nextId":n:4018000000000000,"nextCustomId":n:4008000000000000,"nextAnimalId":n:4047800000000000,"maxGeneration":n:4000000000000000,"usedNames":n:4014000000000000,"winterSeverity":n:3feea780f5733334,"seenWinter":true,"brewing":null,"stats":{"talks":n:4041000000000000,"births":n:3ff0000000000000,"deaths":{"starvation":n:3ff0000000000000,"cold":n:0000000000000000,"age":n:0000000000000000,"wolves":n:0000000000000000,},"failedExperiments":n:4018000000000000,"observations":n:4030000000000000,"conversions":n:0000000000000000,"hunts":n:0000000000000000,"harshWinters":n:0000000000000000,},"traitSum":{"curiosity":n:4003b19ba1bacccd,"social":n:400904127f3f0001,"diligence":n:4004a52358530000,"n":n:4014000000000000,},"agents":[{"id":n:3ff0000000000000,"name":s:"Ask the First","x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,"age":n:4038000000000000,"gen":n:3ff0000000000000,"lifespan":n:404b800000000000,"hunger":n:404a8000000000e4,"energy":n:40526